      "url": "https://www.parliament.vic.gov.au/4a2633/globalassets/tabled-paper-documents/tabled-paper-4708/ibac_-_operation_betka_hdktd95p.pdf",
      "document": "IBAC_-_Operation_Betka_HDKtd95P",
      "page": 8
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "It examined whether the project manager used his departmental position to benefit a company he owned, and how conflicts of interest were disclosed and managed.",
    "cites": [
     {
      "url": "https://www.parliament.vic.gov.au/4a2633/globalassets/tabled-paper-documents/tabled-paper-4708/ibac_-_operation_betka_hdktd95p.pdf",
      "document": "IBAC_-_Operation_Betka_HDKtd95P",
      "page": 8
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "IBAC found that inadequate disclosure and management of the conflict allowed him to influence staffing decisions to benefit his company, but the evidence did not support criminal charges.",
    "cites": [
     {
      "url": "https://www.parliament.vic.gov.au/4a2633/globalassets/tabled-paper-documents/tabled-paper-4708/ibac_-_operation_betka_hdktd95p.pdf",
      "document": "IBAC_-_Operation_Betka_HDKtd95P",
      "page": 32
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "IBAC also found that supervisors failed to record, report and monitor his conflict of interest.",
    "cites": [
     {
      "url": "https://www.parliament.vic.gov.au/4a2633/globalassets/tabled-paper-documents/tabled-paper-4708/ibac_-_operation_betka_hdktd95p.pdf",
      "document": "IBAC_-_Operation_Betka_HDKtd95P",
      "page": 32
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Its two recommendations sought stronger contractor procurement and oversight, and effective compliance with the Department’s conflicts framework.",
    "cites": [
     {
      "url": "https://www.parliament.vic.gov.au/4a2633/globalassets/tabled-paper-documents/tabled-paper-4708/ibac_-_operation_betka_hdktd95p.pdf",
